window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Lost in the night...</p> <p>Vanora is tormented by the night her faith in those she loved was shattered. Despite building a new life for herself far from her childhood home, she cannot escape the dark forces conspiring against her.</p> <p>Lost in the night...</p> <p>Vanora realizes a deadly foe is moving not only against her, but the family she left behind. To save those she loves, she must venture into the darkness and face the enigmatic and dangerous albino vampire that haunts her dreams and visions.</p> <p>Lost in the night...</p> <p>Vanora must trust the man who broke her heart and risk igniting the embers of a love that once nearly destroyed her.</p>"; 
